 specific manual direction and external asset work; not a raw transcript.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[125],{"_69":126,"_31":127,"_119":128},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/jbang2004/long-wind","Game source, shaders, textures, GLB characters and animations are included. Tripo and Mixamo assets have separate terms; see CREDITS.md.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[134],{"_69":135,"_31":136,"_119":137},"Play Long Wind","https://jbang2004.github.io/long-wind/","WASD moves, mouse attacks/guards, Space dodges, Q locks on. Touch controls support landscape play.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[145],{"_69":146,"_31":118,"_119":-7},"Read the creator’s development timeline","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[151,152,153,154],"Try movement, guarding, dodging, and the opening boss.","Read the Chinese development account and human contribution disclosure.","Study the contracts, art bible, and animation pipeline.","Check CREDITS.md before adapting included assets.","AI 工作流与开发背景","作者描述了用中文指挥 Claude Code、试玩改动并提供 Tripo 与 Mixamo 访问权限的过程，README 包含开发时间线。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","资产制作工具",false,[171,172],"assetTools","Tripo","Adobe Mixamo","引擎","Three.js · JavaScript","engine","lead","3d","ai-assisted",[171,172],[151,152,153,154],{"_69":146,"_31":118,"_23":192},{"_69":135,"_31":136,"_23":130,"_119":137},{"_69":189,"_31":127,"_190":191,"_119":128},{"_69":117,"_31":118,"_119":120},[186,187,188],"claude-code","threejs","blender","Open the complete game project","scope","complete-project","build-log","example:sprout-quest-claude","sprout-quest-claude","Sprout Quest","探索小世界，参加实时竞技场战斗，采集材料、锻造装备并重建村庄。Sprout Quest 面向竖屏手机，将二维世界与实时渲染的三维角色、道具组合在一起。","/zh/examples/sprout-quest-claude/",{"_25":194,"_27":195,"_29":196,"_175":260,"_170":261,"_165":262,"_161":263,"_157":256,"_9":264,"_142":265,"_131":266,"_38":267,"_115":268,"_103":269},[200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,2