prompt summary. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[240],{"_69":126,"_31":241,"_119":242},"https://github.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest","Complete game code, runtime GLBs/sprite atlases, Blender scripts and tests. bun install then bun run dev opens localhost:3000; normal builds use committed art and do not require Blender. No root LICENSE was found, so public source visibility does not establish broad reuse permission.",[244],{"_69":245,"_31":246,"_119":247},"Play Sprout Quest","https://aibengineering.github.io/sprout-quest/","Author-hosted browser adventure designed for portrait phones, with desktop keyboard controls and localStorage saves.",[249],{"_69":250,"_31":237,"_119":-7},"阅读作者的开发过程",[252,253,254,255],"Play the portrait-browser prologue and follow its first fight, gathering and forge tasks.","Read the build account to see how human phone playtests guided later Claude Code changes.","Run bun install and bun run dev; inspect the game modules, committed runtime assets and Blender builders.","Change one combat, crafting or story rule with an agent, then replay the affected progression and save flow.","作者称游戏、测试与 Blender 美术流程均由 Claude Code 根据自然语言要求完成；人类负责在手机上试玩并反馈。仓库同时提供运行素材和素材生成脚本，可以研究试玩反馈如何推动后续修改。","AI 生成（创作者归属）","2D",[108],"Custom Canvas 2D + Three.js · TypeScript",[108],"2d","ai-generated",[252,253,254,255],{"_69":271,"_31":237,"_23":192},{"_69":245,"_31":246,"_23":130,"_119":247},{"_69":189,"_31":241,"_119":242,"_190":191},{"_69":270,"_31":237,"_119":238},[186,187,188],"Read the creator’s AI attribution","Read the creator’s build account","example:golden-hour-skatepark-cursor","golden-hour-skatepark-cursor","Golden Hour Skatepark","在原创海边滑板场中压弯、起跳、翻板、滑杆、平衡，摔倒后重新上板。这是完整的第三人称滑板沙盒，显示短暂的技巧连段，支持切换日照，没有关卡或持久积分。","/zh/examples/golden-hour-skatepark-cursor/",{"_25":273,"_27":274,"_29":275,"_175":338,"_170":339,"_165":177,"_161":178,"_157":336,"_9":340,"_142":341,"_131":342,"_38":343,"_115":344,"_103":345},[279,280,281,282,283,284,285,286,287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299],{"_65":27,"_78":274,"_67":27,"_104":-7,"_80":41},{"_65":176,"_78":275,"_67":29,"_104":-7,"_80":41},{"_65":75,"_69":173,"_78":338,"_67":175,"_104":158,"_80":81},{"_65":96,"_69":167,"_148":168,"_71":337,"_67":170,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":163,"_78":164,"_67":165,"_104":166,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":159,"_78":160,"_67":161,"_104":162,"_80":41},{"_65":75,"_69":155,"_78":336,"_67":157,"_104":158,"_80":41},{"_65":96,"_69":147,"_148":149,"_71":331,"_67":9,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":143,"_71":327,"_67":142,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":140,"_78":141,"_67":142,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":138,"_78":139,"_67":131,"_104":-7,"_80":41},{"_65":66,"_69":132,"_71":322,"_67":131,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":129,"_78":130,"_67":131,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":123,"_71":317,"_67":38,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":121,"_78":122,"_67":38,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":113,"_71":312,"_67":115,"_104":-7},{"_65":66,"_69":101,"_71":309,"_67":103,"_104":-7},{"_65":96,"_67":97,"_69":98,"_71":307,"_80":81},{"_65":82,"_67":83,"_69":303,"_85":304,"_87":305,"_38":306,"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95},{"_65":75,"_67":76,"_69":77,"_78":224,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_67":68,"_69":70,"_71":300},[301],{"_69":70,"_31":302},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StarKnightt/skate-park/main/docs/media/02-half-pipe-air.jpg","The creator’s actual half-pipe gameplay frame, with the skater and the procedural park.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/golden-hour-skatepark-cursor.webp","A skater is airborne above a half-pipe in a palm-lined skatepark under a warm evening sky.","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park#readme",[308],"Cursor",[310,311],{"_69":110,"_31":111},{"_69":108,"_31":109},[313],{"_69":314,"_31":315,"_119":316},"阅读作者的 Cursor 开发记录","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park#how-it-was-built","The README explicitly names Cursor AI agents and separates builder passes, critic feedback and human playtests; docs/MAKING-OF.md provides a detailed account. Source-checked; performance and playability claims were not reproduced.",[318],{"_69":319,"_31":320,"_119":321},"查看完整滑板游戏项目","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park","Complete TypeScript game, procedural park code, runtime skater/crowd GLBs, textures, audio and source tools. CI uses Node 22 and pnpm 10.18.0; pnpm install then pnpm dev at 127.0.0.1:5188. Ports are fixed. No root LICENSE was found; CC0 media, Mixamo animations and dependencies keep separate terms.",[323],{"_69":324,"_31":325,"_119":326},"Play Golden Hour Skatepark","https://starknightt.github.io/skate-park/","Browser skating sandbox with keyboard, optional mouse/gamepad and touch controls. Press any key, click or tap to take over from the title-screen rider. Phone testing reported by the creator used desktop emulation; Firefox and desktop Safari remain untested.",[328],{"_69":329,"_31":330,"_119":-7},"阅读实现与评审协作记录","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park/blob/main/docs/MAKING-OF.md",[332,333,334,335],"Play the park and test pushing, carving, one trick, a bail and recovery.","Read the making-of account and separate human feedback, agent implementation and third-party assets.","Use Node 22 with pnpm 10.18.0, then pnpm install and pnpm dev; inspect the collision mesh and character pipeline.","Ask an agent to adjust one movement or camera parameter, then compare transition riding, tricks and recovery across the park.","作者明确表示，Cursor 的 AI 代理通过实现与视觉评审轮次开发游戏，人类试玩推动了控制方式的修改。代码构建的场景与程序化滑行动作，配合 Cursor 生成画作，以及另行署名的 CC0 声音、纹理和 Mixamo 摔倒起身动画。",[108],"Three.js · TypeScript",[108],[332,333,334,335],{"_69":348,"_31":330,"_23":192},{"_69":324,"_31":325,"_23":130,"_119":326},{"_69":347,"_31":320,"_190":191,"_119":321},{"_69":346,"_31":315,"_119":316},[187,188],"Read the creator’s Cursor contribution account","Open the complete skating project","Read the builder-and-critic development account","example:core-business-claude","core-business-claude","Core Business","向下钻掘矿物，管理燃料与机体状态，回到地面商店出售矿产和升级。这是受 Motherload 启发的非商业采矿技术演示：Three.js 渲染 2.5D 世界，Blender 脚本制作三维资产。","/zh/examples/core-business-claude/",{"_25":350,"_27":351,"_29":352,"_175":174,"_165":177,"_161":178,"_157":408,"_9":411,"_142":412,"_131":413,"_38":414,"_115":415,"_103":416,"_170":417},[356,357,358,359,360,361,362,363,364,365,366,367,368,369,370,371,372,373,374,375],{"_65":27,"_78":351,"_67":27,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":176,"_78":352,"_67":29,"_104":-7,"_80":41},{"_65":75,"_69":173,"_78":174,"_67":175,"_104":158,"_80":81},{"_65":96,"_69":167,"_148":168,"_71":409,"_67":170,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":163,"_78":164,"_67":165,"_104":166,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":159,"_78":160,"_67":161,"_104":162,"_80":41},{"_65":75,"_69":155,"_78":408,"_67":157,"_104":158,"_80":41},{"_65":96,"_69":147,"_148":149,"_71":403,"_67":9,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":143,"_71":400,"_67":142,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":140,"_78":141,"_67":142,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":138,"_78":139,"_67":131,"_104":-7,"_80":41},{"_65":66,"_69":132,"_71":396,"_67":131,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":129,"_78":130,"_67":131,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":123,"_71":392,"_67":38,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":121,"_78":122,"_67":38,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":113,"_71":388,"_67":115,"_104":-7},{"_65":66,"_69":101,"_71":385,"_67":103,"_104":-7},{"_65":96,"_67":97,"_69":98,"_71":383,"_80":81},{"_65":82,"_67":83,"_69":378,"_85":379,"_87":380,"_38":381,"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":382},{"_65":75,"_67":376,"_69":377,"_78":224,"_80":81},"captureDate","截图采集","The running author-hosted mining tech demo, captured with the Metal rendering backend.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/core-business-claude.webp","The Core Business mining vehicle in a three-dimensional side-view Mars scene, with fuel, hull, cargo, money and depth indicators.","https://leichtbier.github.io/core-business/","GameMap browser capture",[384],"Claude 模型 / 对话",[386,387],{"_69":110,"_31":111},{"_69":108,"_31":109},[389],{"_69":236,"_31":390,"_119":391},"https://github.com/Leichtbier/core-business#readme","The author explicitly separates Claude-generated work from ElevenLabs audio and credits Motherload/XGen Studios. This does not imply that Claude created the original game’s rules.",[393],{"_69":126,"_31":394,"_119":395},"https://github.com/Leichtbier/core-business","Complete JavaScript game, vendored Three.js, committed GLBs, Blender source scripts, UI, audio and tests. Serve the root, e.g. python3 -m http.server 5173; Blender regeneration is unnecessary for normal play. Code is MIT with explicit exceptions: ElevenLabs audio is supplied for this project, not separate extraction or redistribution; see LICENSE.",[397],{"_69":398,"_31":381,"_119":399},"试玩 Core Business","WebGL browser, keyboard/pointer and touch controls. Initial graphics preparation stalled with the default headless renderer; Chrome with Metal reached normal play. After the opening transmission, brief movement/drilling input produced score 25 and fuel/depth feedback. Full mining progression and audio were not tested.",[401],{"_69":402,"_31":390,"_119":-7},"查看采矿游戏的实现与资产流程",[404,405,406,407],"Start a new game and learn movement, downward drilling, fuel and return-to-surface shops.","Read the fixed-step simulation separately from the Three.js renderer and committed GLB models.","Serve the repository root with a static HTTP server; opening ES modules via file:// does not work.","Change one mineral or upgrade rule, then check drilling, selling, fuel use and save/reload.","作者将游戏代码、测试、纹理、翻译、模型和 Blender 生成脚本归于 Claude Opus 5.5，音效与音乐来自 ElevenLabs。该项目使用新资产重新实现 Motherload 风格的规则，并明确定位为非商业实验；未说明具体编码客户端。",[108,410],"ElevenLabs",[404,405,406,407],{"_69":419,"_31":390,"_23":192},{"_69":418,"_31":381,"_23":130,"_119":399},{"_69":189,"_31":394,"_190":191,"_119":395},{"_69":270,"_31":390,"_119":391},[187,188],[108,410],"Play Core Business","Read the mining game’s implementation and asset pipeline","example:polar-icecapade-claude","polar-icecapade-claude","Polar Icecapade","在冰面 3D 场景中滑行，用三段近战连击向前推进，射击时利用后坐力向后移动。穿过闸门、收集金币，在短篇 Game Jam 冒险中对抗老鼠政权。","/zh/examples/polar-icecapade-claude/",{"_25":421,"_27":422,"_29":423,"_175":484,"_165":177,"_161":178,"_157":480,"_170":485,"_9":475,"_142":486,"_131":487,"_38":488,"_115":489,"_103":490},[427,428,429,430,431,432,433,434,435,436,437,438,439,440,441,442,443,444,445,446],{"_65":27,"_78":422,"_67":27,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":176,"_78":423,"_67":29,"_104":-7,"_80":41},{"_65":75,"_69":173,"_78":484,"_67":175,"_104":158,"_80":81},{"_65":96,"_69":167,"_148":168,"_71":481,"_67":170,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":163,"_78":164,"_67":165,"_104":166,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":159,"_78":160,"_67":161,"_104":162,"_80":41},{"_65":75,"_69":155,"_78":480,"_67":157,"_104":158,"_80":41},{"_65":96,"_69":147,"_148":149,"_71":475,"_67":9,"_104":-7,"_80":41},{"_65":66,"_69":143,"_71":472,"_67":142,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":140,"_78":141,"_67":142,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":138,"_78":471,"_67":131,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":132,"_71":467,"_67":131,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":129,"_78":130,"_67":131,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":123,"_71":462,"_67":38,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":121,"_78":122,"_67":38,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":113,"_71":458,"_67":115,"_104":-7},{"_65":66,"_69":101,"_71":452,"_67":103,"_104":-7},{"_65":96,"_67":97,"_69":98,"_71":451,"_80":81},{"_65":82,"_67":83,"_69":447,"_85":448,"_87":449,"_38":450,"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":382},{"_65":75,"_67":376,"_69":377,"_78":224,"_80":81},"The live first level after melee movement and a shot; ammo has fallen to 11/12.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/polar-icecapade-claude.webp","Polar Icecapade’s first icy 3D arena after melee propulsion and a shot, showing the moving character, gates, coins, timer and 11 of 12 ammunition.","https://evankurtzart.itch.io/polar-icecapade",[100],[453,454,455],{"_69":100,"_31":112},{"_69":456,"_31":457},{"_69":108,"_31":109},"Godot Engine · Official Documentation","/zh/resources/godot-engine/",[459],{"_69":460,"_31":450,"_119":461},"Read the team’s explicit Claude Code assistance statement","The creators distinguish AI help with diagnosing and implementing core code from their own code review, modeling, animation and art. The page links the full game source and identifies Godot 4.6 and GDScript; its “No generative AI” content badge does not erase the separate coding-assistance disclosure.",[463],{"_69":464,"_31":465,"_119":466},"Open the complete Godot game project","https://github.com/afenkurtz/Big-Mode-Game-Jam-2026/tree/main/slick","Complete Godot 4.6 project with levels, GDScript, GLB/FBX models, Blender authoring files, textures, UI and audio. The inspected tree has 292 files, about 239 MB. Open the slick folder; importing Blender authoring files may require a compatible Blender installation. No top-level game license was found; external sounds, music and fonts retain their separately credited terms.",[468],{"_69":469,"_31":450,"_119":470},"Play or download Polar Icecapade on itch.io","Mouse recommended: left-click performs melee propulsion, right-click shoots with recoil, and Escape pauses. Browser review reached the first level, moved, fired a projectile with ammo changing from 12 to 11, and opened pause. The roughly 170 MB web build has author-documented performance limits; Windows/Linux downloads are provided and mobile is not recommended. Later levels and a complete run were not tested.","itch.io",[473],{"_69":474,"_31":450,"_119":-7},"Read the team’s development and asset breakdown",[476,477,478,479],"使用鼠标开始网页首关，测试冰面滑行和近战连击推进。","右键射击，对比向后的后坐力与近战向前推进。","阅读团队对 Claude Code 的说明，以及人工美术、动画和音频署名。","在 Godot 4.6 中打开 slick 工程，修改一项移动或闸门规则，检查首个房间、弹药、暂停与重开。","Aidan “Botodo” Connolly 和 Evan Kurtz 说明 Claude Code 帮助诊断问题、实现困难的核心逻辑，之后他们检查并调整了全部代码。建模、绑定、动画和设计由团队完成，音频另有署名；作者明确说明没有用生成式 AI 制作资产，也未给出编程模型版本。",[108,482,483],"Procreate","Affinity","Godot 4.6 · GDScript · 3D",[108,482,483],{"_69":474,"_31":450,"_23":192},{"_69":469,"_31":450,"_23":130,"_119":470},{"_69":464,"_31":465,"_190":191,"_119":466},{"_69":460,"_31":450,"_119":461},[186,491,188],"godot-engine","example:katana-kitsune-godot","katana-kitsune-godot","Katana Kitsune: Prototype","选择狐妖剑士，在等距视角的动作肉鸽中迎战妖怪、管理体力、拾取道具并深入地牢。这个无声原型支持本地多人，当前源码还记录了后续队伍系统。","/zh/examples/katana-kitsune-godot/",{"_25":493,"_27":494,"_29":495,"_175":567,"_165":262,"_161":178,"_157":561,"_170":568,"_9":556,"_142":569,"_131":570,"_38":571,"_115":572,"_103":573},[499,500,501,502,503,504,505,506,507,508,509,510,511,512,513,514,515,516,517,518,519],{"_65":27,"_78":494,"_67":27,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":176,"_78":495,"_67":29,"_104":-7,"_80":41},{"_65":75,"_69":173,"_78":567,"_67":175,"_104":158,"_80":81},{"_65":96,"_69":167,"_148":168,"_71":562,"_67":170,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":163,"_78":258,"_67":165,"_104":166,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":159,"_78":160,"_67":161,"_104":162,"_80":41},{"_65":75,"_69":155,"_78":561,"_67":157,"_104":158,"_80":41},{"_65":96,"_69":147,"_148":149,"_71":556,"_67":9,"_104":-7,"_80":41},{"_65":66,"_69":143,"_71":552,"_67":142,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":140,"_78":141,"_67":142,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":138,"_78":471,"_67":131,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":132,"_71":548,"_67":131,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":129,"_78":130,"_67":131,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":123,"_71":544,"_67":38,"_104":-7},{"_65":75,"_69":121,"_78":122,"_67":38,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_69":113,"_71":539,"_67":115,"_104":-7},{"_65":66,"_69":101,"_71":529,"_67":103,"_104":-7},{"_65":96,"_67":97,"_69":98,"_71":527,"_80":81},{"_65":82,"_67":83,"_69":523,"_85":524,"_87":525,"_38":526,"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95},{"_65":75,"_67":76,"_69":77,"_78":224,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_67":68,"_69":70,"_71":520},[521],{"_69":70,"_31":522},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune/bc9321eeaac727bbb5372a315ec58f68c96240ac/marketing/itch/05_attack.png","Creator-published combat screenshot from the silent Godot prototype.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/katana-kitsune-godot.webp","The creator’s Katana Kitsune combat screenshot with an isometric courtyard, the party, enemies, health bars and minimap.","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune/blob/bc9321eeaac727bbb5372a315ec58f68c96240ac/marketing/itch/05_attack.png",[100,528],"GitHub Copilot",[530,531,532,533,534],{"_69":100,"_31":112},{"_69":456,"_31":457},{"_69":537,"_31":538},{"_69":535,"_31":536},{"_69":108,"_31":109},"Meshy API","/zh/resources/meshy/","PixelLab AI Agent Toolkit","/zh/resources/pixellab/",[540],{"_69":541,"_31":542,"_119":543},"Read the creator’s AI production disclosure","https://9-k9.itch.io/katanakitsune","The author explicitly names Claude Code and GitHub Copilot alongside image, sprite and 3D asset tools, and links the primary complete source repository. The README verifies the Godot version and explains which finished assets are included.",[545],{"_69":464,"_31":546,"_119":547},"https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune","Godot 4.7 project with scenes, GDScript, Dialogic addon and finished sprite assets. The inspected tree contains about 383 MB of files; no top-level game license was found. The upstream Meshy/Blender/PixelOver authoring pipeline is separate, while its finished runtime sprites are committed. The current source contains newer party/asset changes than the reviewed hosted prototype.",[549],{"_69":550,"_31":542,"_119":551},"Play Katana Kitsune on itch.io","Silent HTML5 prototype with keyboard and gamepad support. Space confirms player/device choices; allow a clear press and release between setup steps. The browser build loaded and reached player/device selection in review; combat and a complete dungeon run were not exercised. The download is large: about 184 MB of game data plus 40 MB of WebAssembly.",[553],{"_69":554,"_31":555,"_119":-7},"Read the game and asset-pipeline documentation","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune#readme",[557,558,559,560],"打开 itch 原型，选择一名真人玩家，认领键盘并选择服装。","阅读作者的 AI 披露，以及角色、战斗和精灵制作流程说明。","在 Godot 4.7 中通过 GL Compatibility 打开 project.godot；工程已包含可运行精灵和游戏场景。","调整一项战斗或生成参数，检查标题、选角、地牢、受伤和重开的完整衔接。","作者明确列出 Claude Code、GitHub Copilot、GPT Image 2、PixelLab 和 Meshy 等制作工具。仓库记录了 Meshy 绑定动画、Blender 重定向和 PixelOver 精灵导出流程；没有说明确切编程模型或各助手的代码分工。游戏里的 NPC 队友并不是 AI 辅助开发的证据。",[563,564,565,108,566],"GPT Image 2","PixelLab","Meshy","PixelOver","Godot 4.7 · GDScript · 2D / GL Compatibility",[563,564,565,108,566],{"_69":554,"_31":555,"_23":192},{"_69":550,"_31":542,"_23":130,"_119":551},{"_69":464,"_31":546,"_190":191,"_119":547},{"_69":541,"_31":542,"_119":543},[186,491,574,575,188],"pixellab","meshy","resource:blender","resource","用于建模、材质、绑定、动画、模拟和渲染的开源 3D 创作套件。","/zh/resources/",{"_25":188,"_643":108,"_161":644,"_65":645,"_642":578,"_637":636,"_31":600,"_66":646,"_617":647,"_611":648,"_608":649,"_605":79},[583,584,585,586,587,588,589,590,591,592,593,594,595],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_65":27,"_78":108,"_67":643,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":176,"_78":578,"_67":642,"_104":-7,"_80":41},{"_65":75,"_69":640,"_78":641,"_67":161,"_104":166,"_80":41},{"_65":75,"_69":638,"_78":639,"_67":65,"_104":166,"_80":41},{"_65":75,"_69":635,"_78":636,"_67":637,"_104":158,"_80":41},{"_65":66,"_69":123,"_71":633,"_67":31,"_104":-7},{"_65":66,"_69":622,"_71":623,"_67":66,"_104":-7},{"_65":96,"_69":615,"_148":168,"_71":616,"_67":617,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":96,"_69":609,"_148":168,"_71":610,"_67":611,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":96,"_69":606,"_148":168,"_71":607,"_67":608,"_104":-7,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_69":604,"_78":79,"_67":605,"_104":166,"_80":81},{"_65":75,"_67":601,"_69":602,"_78":603,"_80":81},{"_65":66,"_67":596,"_69":597,"_71":598},"identitySource","身份来源",[599],{"_69":108,"_31":600},"https://github.com/blender/blender","identity","项目身份与署名","Official Blender mirror and API quickstart source. The official organization avatar uses the Blender brand mark.","来源核查","verified","适用方向",[164],"dimensions","开发阶段",[612,613,614],"stages","资产与动画","引擎与场景","测试验证","主题",[108,618,619,620,621],"tags","DCC","3D assets","Animation","开源","延伸阅读",[624,625,626],{"